# skills excludes — deployment artifacts a skill must never smuggle into VCS.
# A copied skill can carry an installed virtualenv, a vendored tool's own .git,
# or build/test caches; none of those are skill source. (See crypto-ctf: 313 MB
# .venv + a nested RsaCtfTool/.git — vendor only SKILL.md + scripts.)
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.git/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.pyc
